OpenCV Zoo — YuNet face detection (ONNX)
----------------------------------------
Used by the API face pipeline for bounding boxes and 5-point landmarks.
Model file: `face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx` (see `apps/api/Dockerfile`).
MIT License. https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_detection_yunet

OpenCV Zoo — SFace face recognition (ONNX)
------------------------------------------
Used by the API for 128-dimensional face embeddings.
Model file: `face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx`.
Apache License, Version 2.0.
https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface

ONNX Runtime (onnxruntime-node)
-------------------------------
Runs YuNet and SFace inference in Node.js. MIT License.
https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

Legacy note: TensorFlow.js and @vladmandic/face-api were removed from the API
in favor of the stack above. Do not mix old face-api embeddings with SFace vectors.

Weaviate
--------
When self-hosted via Docker Compose, the Weaviate server image is used
(`docker-compose.yml`). Weaviate is licensed under BSD-3-Clause.
https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate

Weaviate Cloud (optional) is a separate hosted service with its own terms.

